IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pa-tort-dates`
IMPORT `pa-tort`

-- Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) -- worked cases for the questions of the person whose privacy was invaded (Schedule 2, Part V
-- representative complaints and determinations, Part IIIA ss 25 and 25A).
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Expected values were written by hand
-- from the text before the file was run; none was copied from the encoding's output. All facts are HYPOTHETICAL.
--
-- Sourced from the Federal Register of Legislation, Commonwealth of Australia, CC BY 4.0 (SOURCE-LICENSE.md).
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

